OL,3,GNEWSAHouseholds open homes to share
OL,4,Agreen energy tips
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of households will be opening
OL,7,Ftheir homes to showcase their renewable
OL,8,Fenergy installations and sustainable
OL,9,Fways of living.
OL,11,FMembers of the public can visit more
OL,12,Fthan 50 properties across Dorset to see
OL,13,Feverything from solar panels to
OL,14,Frainwater harvesting and ask the owners
OL,15,Fquestions about how they made their
OL,16,Fhomes more efficient.
OL,18,FAmong those taking part is Alan
OL,19,FMuncaster, who bought his Weymouth
OL,20,Fbungalow in 2010 and has been improving
OL,21,Fit ever since.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
