OL,3,GNEWSAHouseholds open homes to share
OL,4,Agreen energy tips
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he had already recouped the
OL,7,Fmoney he spent on solar panels and,
OL,8,Fthis year, broke even on his energy
OL,9,Fbills after selling excess electricity
OL,10,Fback to the grid.
